  "verseCount": 14,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "12",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "HOS 12"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "12",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ephraim feedeth on wind, and followeth after the east wind: he daily increaseth lies and desolation; and they do make a covenant with the Assyrians, and oil is carried into Egypt.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.12.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.12.3"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hath also a controversy with Judah, and will punish Jacob according to his ways; according to his doings will he recompense him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶ He took his brother by the heel in the womb, and by his strength he had power with God:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yea, he had power over the angel, and prevailed: he wept, and made supplication unto him: he found him",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "in",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.12.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.12.5"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Beth-el, and there he spake with us;",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Even the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.12.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.12.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "God of hosts; the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.12.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.12.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.12.5",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.12.6"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "his memorial.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Therefore turn thou to thy God: keep mercy and judgment, and wait on thy God continually.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "¶",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "He is",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.12.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.12.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "a merchant, the balances of deceit",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.12.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.12.8"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "in his hand: he loveth to oppress.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Ephraim said, Yet I am become rich, I have found me out substance:",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "in",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.12.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.12.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "all my labours they shall find none iniquity in me that",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "were",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.12.8",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.12.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "sin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And I",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "that am",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.12.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.12.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.12.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.12.10"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thy God from the land of Egypt will yet make thee to dwell in tabernacles, as in the days of the solemn feast.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I have also spoken by the prophets, and I have multiplied visions, and used similitudes, by the ministry of the prophets.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Is there",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.12.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.12.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "iniquity",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "in",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.12.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.12.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gilead? surely they are vanity: they sacrifice bullocks in Gilgal; yea, their altars",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "are",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.12.11",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.12.12"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "as heaps in the furrows of the fields.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Jacob fled into the country of Syria, and Israel served for a wife, and for a wife he kept",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "sheep",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.12.12",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.12.13"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And by a prophet the",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "LORD",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.12.13",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.12.14"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "brought Israel out of Egypt, and by a prophet was he preserved.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "HOS 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ephraim provoked",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "add"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "him",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "HOS.12.14",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "HOS.12.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "to anger most bitterly: therefore shall he leave his blood upon him, and his reproach shall his Lord return unto him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "HOS.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "HOS.12.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
